<section class="prose"><p class="eyebrow">AI visibility research · Sep 24, 2026</p><h1>AI visibility APIs: current evidence map</h1><p class="lede">For this research, AI visibility means programmatic evidence about brand, keyword or prompt presence in AI-powered search experiences. Feature labels alone are not treated as equivalent measurements.</p>
<h2>DataForSEO</h2><p>Official documentation describes AI Optimization APIs including LLM Mentions and AI Keyword Data. These are documented capabilities; Search Data Bench has not yet executed a comparable live AI-visibility benchmark.</p><p><TrackedLink href="https://try.dataforseo.com/3zzt96c0svoj" label="Visit DataForSEO" affiliate={true} eventId="affiliate-dataforseo-ai-visibility" /></p>
<h2>Mangools AI Search Watcher</h2><p>Official documentation describes programmatic management of monitors, models, prompts and settings. Authenticated SDB entitlement and comparable production cost remain unresolved.</p>
<h2>SE Ranking</h2><p>Our preserved SE Ranking hands-on run covers keyword, SERP, rank, competitive and backlink tasks, not an AI-visibility workload. We therefore leave this cell unresolved rather than extrapolating.</p><p><TrackedLink href="https://seranking.com/?ga=5265149&source=link" label="Explore SE Ranking" affiliate={true} eventId="affiliate-seranking-ai-visibility" /></p><p><a href="/methodology/">Evidence rules →</a></p></section></BaseLayout>